From 50060cc53ee43d5b2948000731e6d250b39ca620 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Lane A <lane-a@local.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:47:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 13/22] fix(tools): try-it renders survive a page restart;
 gate-compare clip manifest

Renders now start in their own process group, so Ctrl+C in the page's
terminal no longer kills a running job (it killed the owner's first run).
GATE_COMPARE_CLIPS.md lists every comparison clip's public source and
exact excerpt so the table can be reproduced on Linux.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/phase2/GATE_COMPARE_CLIPS.md | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/phase2/try_it.py             |  6 +++++-
 2 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/phase2/GATE_COMPARE_CLIPS.md

diff --git a/tools/phase2/GATE_COMPARE_CLIPS.md b/tools/phase2/GATE_COMPARE_CLIPS.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..da3f3b3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tools/phase2/GATE_COMPARE_CLIPS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
